                "target": "CopyObject",
                "summary": "A copy whose resolved source names the same bucket, key and version as the destination is refused with InvalidRequest when nothing about the object would change, and is otherwise the sanctioned way to rewrite metadata in place — so the destination's bytes must survive it untouched and must never be truncated by opening the target before the source has been read.",
